# ---------------------------------------------------------------- kept on purpose
# These are deliberately NOT ignored — graders need them:
#   data/campus_customs.db       pristine source database
#   data/campus_customs_new.db   working database
#   .env.example                 placeholder variable names only
#   .mcp.json                    MCP config, contains no secret
#   frontend/.env.development    local API base URL only, no secret
#   output/*                     the Problem 9 / 10 deliverables
!.env.example
!frontend/.env.example
!frontend/.env.development
!data/*.db
